      "created_at": "2021-10-09T00:07:12.274Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a Child Table with a field I would like to use to create connections on to another Doctype. However, I can’t figure out how to get it to work properly.</p>\n<p>Here is the relevant part of my Child Table, which highlights the <code>store</code> field (the field I want to link on):<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/5/c5d4cd842673da16e56371de3959c5ab172e0986.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"se5ZlUccGHsVwB1UZzXX90NxBd4\" width=\"285\" height=\"258\"><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I have another Doctype called “Dividers Store”, and I want to add a “Connections” category to this field, like so:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/7/c7d07e087ca3c1f563543f361826777fbb6d6a39.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c7d07e087ca3c1f563543f361826777fbb6d6a39\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c7d07e087ca3c1f563543f361826777fbb6d6a39_2_690x134.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"svDHYJApU9AVcxYkTzuGhjKHNJD\" width=\"690\" height=\"134\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c7d07e087ca3c1f563543f361826777fbb6d6a39_2_690x134.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/7/c7d07e087ca3c1f563543f361826777fbb6d6a39.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/7/c7d07e087ca3c1f563543f361826777fbb6d6a39.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F7F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">877×171 12.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>However, I can’t get it to work (the above screenshot was taken before I placed the field in a Child Table).</p>\n<p>When I edit the “Dividers Store” Doctype and scroll down to “Linked Documents”, I can add connections to Link fields here. However, I can’t get Child Tables to work, even though the interface appears to be designed to handle them. Here is my attempt:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/5/250b15cdf919aed15af296fdd6fc38fe460fea2e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/250b15cdf919aed15af296fdd6fc38fe460fea2e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/5/250b15cdf919aed15af296fdd6fc38fe460fea2e_2_665x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5hHpObOZIsE99cZ5YF4nAF98DEO\" width=\"665\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/5/250b15cdf919aed15af296fdd6fc38fe460fea2e_2_665x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/5/250b15cdf919aed15af296fdd6fc38fe460fea2e.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/5/250b15cdf919aed15af296fdd6fc38fe460fea2e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">835×627 29.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The field in the “Dividers Store Waiting List” is called <code>stores</code>; it contains a Child Table called “Dividers Store Waiting List Stores”, with the field <code>stores</code> - the field I want to create connections on. When I attempt to save this, I get the following error:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>AttributeError: ‘DocType’ object has no attribute ‘get_field’</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If I switch the “Link Fieldname” and “Table Fieldname” field values, I get the following error:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Row <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#2:</span> Could not find field stores in Dividers Store Waiting List Stores DocType</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>What am I doing wrong?</p>",
