      "created_at": "2025-05-14T21:26:05.136Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can get this to work if I edit the DocType JSON directly as follows:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\"> \"links\": [\n  {\n   \"is_child_table\": 1,\n   \"link_doctype\": \"Child Doctype\",\n   \"link_fieldname\": \"field_in_child_table\",\n   \"parent_doctype\": \"Parent DocType\",\n   \"table_fieldname\": \"field_in_parent_table\"\n  }\n ],\n</code></pre>\n<p>The <code>Journal Entry</code> DocType in ERPNext has a child link as an example:<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/doctype/journal_entry/journal_entry.json#L551\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">erpnext/erpnext/accounts/doctype/journal_entry/journal_entry.json at develop · frappe/erpnext</a></p>\n<p>However, I cannot get this to work from the UI.  The main issue I am facing is that the <code>Is Child Table</code> checkbox is grayed out and cannot be checked.</p>",
