      "created_at": "2025-06-02T07:12:20.265Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"teharris1\" data-post=\"12\" data-topic=\"81148\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/teharris1/48/79687_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> teharris1:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The <code>Journal Entry</code> DocType in ERPNext has a child link as an example:<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/doctype/journal_entry/journal_entry.json#L551\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">erpnext/erpnext/accounts/doctype/journal_entry/journal_entry.json at develop · frappe/erpnext </a></p>\n<p>However, I cannot get this to work from the UI. The main issue I am facing is that the <code>Is Child Table</code> checkbox is grayed out and cannot be checked.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I found an easy way to do it, officially supported by ERPNext.<br>\nIn the Linked Documents of the Doctype open the full modal using the pen.</p>\n<p>The Doctype field would be the parent DocType, then the Link field would be the name of the link field <strong>inside the child table</strong>, not the parent. Lastly, add the child field name as it is named in the parent Doctype. (e.g. child table doctype named <code>Maintenance Services Table</code> but the field is named ‘maintenance_services’ in the <code>Maintenance Job</code> parent doctype. Then, put the maintenance_services in the third field). Again, the employee is the link field inside the <code>Maintenance Services Table</code> child doctype.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/c/7c48dadfbd112b31b3c65ea76a48055affeef8ce.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7c48dadfbd112b31b3c65ea76a48055affeef8ce\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c48dadfbd112b31b3c65ea76a48055affeef8ce_2_690x281.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hJtirdrfDJZ0NE5U7NRONgvakj4\" width=\"690\" height=\"281\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c48dadfbd112b31b3c65ea76a48055affeef8ce_2_690x281.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c48dadfbd112b31b3c65ea76a48055affeef8ce_2_1035x421.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/c/7c48dadfbd112b31b3c65ea76a48055affeef8ce_2_1380x562.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1799×733 36.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
